WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.667 --> 00:00:03.901
♪♪

00:00:03.901 --> 00:00:05.567
-Let's get to the news.

00:00:05.567 --> 00:00:07.601
President Biden said on Friday

00:00:07.601 --> 00:00:09.834
that Russia would pay
"a severe price"

00:00:09.834 --> 00:00:12.100
if they used
chemical weapons in Ukraine.

00:00:12.100 --> 00:00:15.634
A severe price,
or as it's now known, "premium."

00:00:15.634 --> 00:00:17.734
[ Laughter ]

00:00:17.734 --> 00:00:19.601
President Biden spoke on Friday

00:00:19.601 --> 00:00:22.267
with Ukrainian
President Volodymyr Zelenskyy

00:00:22.267 --> 00:00:23.868
for nearly 50 minutes.

00:00:23.868 --> 00:00:26.634
Zelenskyy asked for more
sanctions against Russia,

00:00:26.634 --> 00:00:31.100
like maybe call Putin and keep
him on the phone for 50 minutes.

00:00:31.100 --> 00:00:32.834
[ Laughter ]

00:00:32.834 --> 00:00:35.667
The head of Russia's
National Guard said yesterday

00:00:35.667 --> 00:00:38.400
that the invasion of Ukraine
has been slower than expected.

00:00:38.400 --> 00:00:41.234
Oh, interesting. I wonder
what his replacement will say.

00:00:41.234 --> 00:00:42.434
"Things are right on track!"

00:00:42.434 --> 00:00:45.734
[ Laughter ]

00:00:45.734 --> 00:00:47.067
President Biden on Friday

00:00:47.067 --> 00:00:48.501
urged House Democrats

00:00:48.501 --> 00:00:50.367
to talk up
the party's accomplishments

00:00:50.367 --> 00:00:51.934
going into midterm elections.

00:00:51.934 --> 00:00:55.968
Said Democrats, "Um,
we got Pelosi's lectern back?"

00:00:55.968 --> 00:00:58.300
[ Laughter ]

00:00:58.300 --> 00:01:00.534
United Airlines
announced last week

00:01:00.534 --> 00:01:03.334
that employees
who were placed on unpaid leave

00:01:03.334 --> 00:01:04.968
for refusing to get vaccinated

00:01:04.968 --> 00:01:06.567
can return to work
later this month.

00:01:06.567 --> 00:01:09.400
So don't worry, your pilot
might be unvaccinated,

00:01:09.400 --> 00:01:11.601
but at least
he's also out of practice.

00:01:11.601 --> 00:01:14.467
[ Laughter ]

00:01:14.467 --> 00:01:16.634
A Florida man
was arrested last week

00:01:16.634 --> 00:01:18.801
after he allegedly
called the police

00:01:18.801 --> 00:01:22.167
and asked them to test
the crystal meth he purchased

00:01:22.167 --> 00:01:24.801
to ensure it was authentic.

00:01:24.801 --> 00:01:26.300
[ Laughter ]

00:01:26.300 --> 00:01:29.701
Said the man,
"So is that a yes?"

00:01:29.701 --> 00:01:31.434
[ Laughter ]

00:01:32.834 --> 00:01:34.734
[ Chuckles ]

00:01:34.734 --> 00:01:36.133
"I get one phone call?

00:01:36.133 --> 00:01:38.167
I got great news, Scootch!"

00:01:38.167 --> 00:01:39.634
[ Laughter ]

00:01:42.234 --> 00:01:43.667
During a recent episode

00:01:43.667 --> 00:01:46.000
of the competition show
"The Masked Singer,"

00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:48.334
a contestant accidentally
knocked their mask off.

00:01:48.334 --> 00:01:50.067
Luckily, since it was
"The Masked Singer,"

00:01:50.067 --> 00:01:51.934
the judges
still didn't know who it was.

00:01:51.934 --> 00:01:54.067
[ Laughter ]

00:01:54.067 --> 00:01:56.167
"Oh, it's the guy
from the thing."

00:01:56.167 --> 00:01:58.567
[ Laughter ]

00:01:58.567 --> 00:02:01.634
Actor Jussie Smollett
was sentenced to five months

00:02:01.634 --> 00:02:04.467
in a Chicago jail last week
for staging a hate crime.

00:02:04.467 --> 00:02:05.701
Here's what you do, Jussie.

00:02:05.701 --> 00:02:06.667
First day in the joint,

00:02:06.667 --> 00:02:08.167
walk up to the biggest guy
in there

00:02:08.167 --> 00:02:10.400
and say, "Act like
you're beating me up.

00:02:10.400 --> 00:02:12.767
[ Laughter ]

00:02:12.767 --> 00:02:15.767
It never doesn't work."

00:02:15.767 --> 00:02:18.534
According to a new poll,
Seattle is the most desirable

00:02:18.534 --> 00:02:20.701
post-graduation city
for college students.

00:02:20.701 --> 00:02:24.567
That story again -- Gen Z just
discovered "Frasier" on Peacock.

00:02:24.567 --> 00:02:26.901
[ Laughter ]

00:02:29.133 --> 00:02:30.868
That story, again --
Karen,

00:02:30.868 --> 00:02:33.100
our writer Karen,
just discovered "Frasier."

00:02:33.100 --> 00:02:35.701
[ Laughter ]

00:02:35.701 --> 00:02:37.467
And finally, a man in Florida --

00:02:37.467 --> 00:02:39.567
by the way, I had to separate
our Florida jokes.

00:02:39.567 --> 00:02:40.968
[ Laughter ]

00:02:40.968 --> 00:02:43.901
We're just going to act
like this is the first one,

00:02:43.901 --> 00:02:46.567
but we all remember the crystal
meth guy a few jokes back.

00:02:46.567 --> 00:02:48.167
[ Laughter ]

00:02:48.167 --> 00:02:50.968
[ Chuckles ]
That guy went first.

00:02:50.968 --> 00:02:52.234
When we ordered them,
we were like,

00:02:52.234 --> 00:02:55.567
"That one, I think
we can put him early."

00:02:55.567 --> 00:02:57.634
And finally, a man in Florida
was arrested last week

00:02:57.634 --> 00:02:59.868
after he was
allegedly caught masturbating

00:02:59.868 --> 00:03:01.834
in a Miami Beach Starbucks.

00:03:01.834 --> 00:03:04.067
Employees suspected
the man was unhinged

00:03:04.067 --> 00:03:07.067
the moment he ordered
a Starbucks breakfast sandwich.

00:03:07.067 --> 00:03:09.534
[ Laughter ]

00:03:11.000 --> 00:03:13.033
In the end,
it was a joke about Starbucks.

00:03:13.033 --> 00:03:14.400
[ Laughter ]
♪♪

00:03:14.400 --> 00:03:17.934
West Virginia Senator
Joe Manchin announced yesterday

00:03:17.934 --> 00:03:20.400
that he opposes
President Biden's nominee

00:03:20.400 --> 00:03:22.634
for the Federal Reserve Board,
before adding,

00:03:22.634 --> 00:03:24.734
"But out of curiosity,
who is it?"

00:03:24.734 --> 00:03:26.767
[ Laughter ]

00:03:26.767 --> 00:03:28.200
The White House said yesterday

00:03:28.200 --> 00:03:30.767
that National Security Advisor
Jake Sullivan

00:03:30.767 --> 00:03:32.601
had a 7-hour conversation

00:03:32.601 --> 00:03:35.234
with a top Chinese
diplomat in Rome.

00:03:35.234 --> 00:03:36.400
I hate to be the one
to tell you this,

00:03:36.400 --> 00:03:38.901
but seven hours
is a breakup talk.

00:03:38.901 --> 00:03:42.501
No one -- no one's ever said,
"Well, my girlfriend and I

00:03:42.501 --> 00:03:44.467
were up talking all night,
and she loves the way

00:03:44.467 --> 00:03:46.501
I load the dishwasher
and everything's going great."

00:03:46.501 --> 00:03:48.234
[ Laughter ]

00:03:48.234 --> 00:03:50.834
Tesla CEO Elon Musk
yesterday challenged

00:03:50.834 --> 00:03:54.267
Russian President Vladimir Putin
to "single combat."

00:03:54.267 --> 00:03:57.534
Oh, come on, give me
somebody to root for.

00:03:57.534 --> 00:03:58.934
[ Laughter ]

00:03:58.934 --> 00:04:01.367
This is like hearing
the New York Yankees

00:04:01.367 --> 00:04:02.901
want to play against Duke.

00:04:02.901 --> 00:04:05.334
[ Laughter ]

00:04:05.334 --> 00:04:08.033
Iowa Senator Chuck Grassley
said recently

00:04:08.033 --> 00:04:10.667
that Senate Republicans
will be fair and thorough

00:04:10.667 --> 00:04:12.567
during the upcoming
confirmation hearings

00:04:12.567 --> 00:04:15.501
for Supreme Court nominee
Ketanji Brown Jackson

00:04:15.501 --> 00:04:17.634
and added, "We're not going
to get in the gutter

00:04:17.634 --> 00:04:18.901
like the Democrats did."

00:04:18.901 --> 00:04:20.934
Though, to be fair,
they only got in the gutter

00:04:20.934 --> 00:04:22.868
because that's where
Brett Kavanaugh passed out,

00:04:22.868 --> 00:04:25.100
so...
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:04:25.100 --> 00:04:28.567
Mayor Eric Adams joined the
social media platform

00:04:28.567 --> 00:04:32.300
TikTok yesterday
and said in his first video,

00:04:32.300 --> 00:04:37.033
"Bing bong, New York City,
your mayor is on TikTok.

00:04:37.033 --> 00:04:40.133
Let's get stuff done."
Okay.

00:04:40.133 --> 00:04:42.868
Being on TikTok is what we do

00:04:42.868 --> 00:04:45.667
when we don't want
to get stuff done.

00:04:45.667 --> 00:04:47.400
That's like saying,
"We got a lot of work to do,

00:04:47.400 --> 00:04:49.167
somebody fire up 'Elden Ring.'"

00:04:49.167 --> 00:04:51.267
[ Laughter ]

00:04:51.267 --> 00:04:53.901
That's right, Eric Adams
joined TikTok yesterday

00:04:53.901 --> 00:04:56.801
and said in his first video,
"Bing bong, New York City."

00:04:56.801 --> 00:04:58.701
Oh, boy.

00:04:58.701 --> 00:05:01.501
If Eric Adams
was New York City's dad,

00:05:01.501 --> 00:05:05.067
we'd be asking him to drop us
off two blocks away from school.

00:05:06.834 --> 00:05:08.133
"Your friends
will love bing bong."

00:05:08.133 --> 00:05:09.200
Just, no!

00:05:09.200 --> 00:05:11.567
[ Laughter ]

00:05:11.567 --> 00:05:15.267
According to a new study,
trained ants may be effective

00:05:15.267 --> 00:05:16.901
in detecting cancer in humans,

00:05:16.901 --> 00:05:19.100
or at least more effective
than others.

00:05:19.100 --> 00:05:20.601
"It's cancer!

00:05:20.601 --> 00:05:22.901
Whatever you're typing in
right now, it's cancer!"

00:05:22.901 --> 00:05:24.467
[ Laughter ]

00:05:24.467 --> 00:05:26.934
Country legend Dolly Parton
announced yesterday

00:05:26.934 --> 00:05:28.300
that she will remove her name

00:05:28.300 --> 00:05:30.567
from the Rock &amp; Roll
Hall of Fame ballot.

00:05:30.567 --> 00:05:32.000
But Dolly is not
going to like this.

00:05:32.000 --> 00:05:35.367
They're replacing her
on the ballot with Jolene.

00:05:35.367 --> 00:05:37.701
[ Audience groans ]

00:05:40.367 --> 00:05:42.267
[ Laughter ]

00:05:46.601 --> 00:05:47.934
Head writer Alex Baze and I had

00:05:47.934 --> 00:05:49.200
a conversation
right before the show.

00:05:49.200 --> 00:05:50.834
We had no idea how that joke
was going to go.

00:05:50.834 --> 00:05:52.434
[ Laughter ]

00:05:52.434 --> 00:05:54.100
I will say, of the many ways
we thought,

00:05:54.100 --> 00:05:55.234
that wasn't one of them.

00:05:55.234 --> 00:05:57.934
[ Laughter ]

00:05:57.934 --> 00:06:00.734
And finally, in honor
of St. Patrick's Day,

00:06:00.734 --> 00:06:03.868
Krispy Kreme will release
four new flavors of doughnuts.

00:06:03.868 --> 00:06:06.334
Though, if you really want
to honor the Irish,

00:06:06.334 --> 00:06:08.667
I think you do no flavor.

00:06:08.667 --> 00:06:10.434
[ Audience groans ]

00:06:10.434 --> 00:06:12.601
[ Laughter ]

00:06:14.000 --> 00:06:15.734
I mean, to make
a St. Patrick's Day joke

00:06:15.734 --> 00:06:20.601
that's not about alcoholism
and is about bad cooking,

00:06:20.601 --> 00:06:21.968
I think that shows
some real restraint.

00:06:21.968 --> 00:06:22.968
[ Laughter ]

00:06:22.968 --> 00:06:24.334
♪♪

00:06:24.334 --> 00:06:26.868
Ukrainian
President Volodymyr Zelenskyy

00:06:26.868 --> 00:06:29.367
delivered a virtual address
to Congress this morning

00:06:29.367 --> 00:06:31.601
and received a standing ovation,

00:06:31.601 --> 00:06:34.834
making him the first comedian
to actually deserve one.

00:06:34.834 --> 00:06:36.734
[ Laughter ]

00:06:36.734 --> 00:06:39.033
Zelenskyy also called
on President Biden

00:06:39.033 --> 00:06:41.100
"to be the leader of the world"
and said,

00:06:41.100 --> 00:06:42.701
"being the leader of the world

00:06:42.701 --> 00:06:44.434
means being the leader
of peace,"

00:06:44.434 --> 00:06:46.734
whereas being the leader
of the world

00:06:46.734 --> 00:06:48.200
during the Trump years meant

00:06:48.200 --> 00:06:49.601
being Angela Merkel.

00:06:49.601 --> 00:06:51.534
[ Laughter ]

00:06:51.534 --> 00:06:53.734
Second gentleman Doug Emhoff

00:06:53.734 --> 00:06:56.367
tested positive yesterday
for COVID-19.

00:06:56.367 --> 00:06:57.467
You guessed it --

00:06:57.467 --> 00:06:58.767
Phish concert.

00:06:58.767 --> 00:07:01.367
[ Laughter and cheering ]

00:07:01.367 --> 00:07:03.267
Former President Trump said,
in a new interview,

00:07:03.267 --> 00:07:04.701
that he was surprised

00:07:04.701 --> 00:07:07.267
when Russian President
Vladimir Putin invaded Ukraine.

00:07:07.267 --> 00:07:10.801
Really? 'Cause he invaded
Ukraine in 2014.

00:07:10.801 --> 00:07:14.100
When you're surprised by a thing
that's already happened,

00:07:14.100 --> 00:07:15.234
that's a symptom.

00:07:15.234 --> 00:07:18.100
[ Laughter ]

00:07:18.100 --> 00:07:21.667
"Well, you finally came
to see your old grandpa."

00:07:21.667 --> 00:07:23.033
[ Laughter ]

00:07:23.033 --> 00:07:24.901
I was here yesterday.

00:07:24.901 --> 00:07:26.033
[ Laughter ]

00:07:26.033 --> 00:07:28.200
"You're as rude as the fella
from yesterday!"

00:07:28.200 --> 00:07:30.200
[ Laughter ]

00:07:30.200 --> 00:07:33.801
Ohio Governor Mike DeWine
signed a bill into law this week

00:07:33.801 --> 00:07:35.501
that allows gun owners to carry

00:07:35.501 --> 00:07:37.701
concealed weapons
without a special permit.

00:07:37.701 --> 00:07:40.367
Well, what could possibly
go off?

00:07:40.367 --> 00:07:43.200
[ Laughter and ohs ]

00:07:45.667 --> 00:07:48.167
President Biden signed
a funding bill yesterday

00:07:48.167 --> 00:07:50.467
to keep the federal government
running through September.

00:07:50.467 --> 00:07:52.834
It was either that
or take a summer job.

00:07:52.834 --> 00:07:55.467
[ Laughter ]

00:07:55.467 --> 00:07:57.667
He would love that.

00:07:57.667 --> 00:07:59.567
The Senate
passed a bill yesterday

00:07:59.567 --> 00:08:02.868
that would make Daylight Saving
Time permanent across the U.S.

00:08:02.868 --> 00:08:05.934
Finally, a rare victory
for your oven clock.

00:08:05.934 --> 00:08:09.868
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:08:09.868 --> 00:08:13.467
A man in the UK who was recently
arrested for driving recklessly

00:08:13.467 --> 00:08:15.767
gave authorities a LEGOLAND ID

00:08:15.767 --> 00:08:18.501
[ Laughter ]
when they asked
for documentation.

00:08:18.501 --> 00:08:20.534
They then charged him
with resisting arrest,

00:08:20.534 --> 00:08:22.334
when he refused to get
out of the vehicle.

00:08:22.334 --> 00:08:23.534
"I can't!

00:08:23.534 --> 00:08:24.501
I'm snapped in!"

00:08:24.501 --> 00:08:27.534
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:08:29.834 --> 00:08:31.434
Senate Majority Leader
Chuck Schumer

00:08:31.434 --> 00:08:33.100
and West Virginia
Senator Joe Manchin

00:08:33.100 --> 00:08:35.667
reportedly had a secret dinner
last month

00:08:35.667 --> 00:08:37.567
at an Italian restaurant
on Capitol Hill

00:08:37.567 --> 00:08:40.067
to help repair
their strained relationship.

00:08:40.067 --> 00:08:42.334
And I think it might be working.

00:08:42.334 --> 00:08:45.267
[ Laughter ]

00:08:45.267 --> 00:08:49.133
According to a new survey,
55% of pet owners said

00:08:49.133 --> 00:08:52.334
that their dog experiencing
separation anxiety

00:08:52.334 --> 00:08:55.167
is their biggest concern
about returning to the office.

00:08:55.167 --> 00:08:56.667
"Kids'll be fine, though.

00:08:56.667 --> 00:08:59.567
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:08:59.567 --> 00:09:01.067
They got each other."

00:09:01.067 --> 00:09:02.634
[ Laughter ]

00:09:02.634 --> 00:09:03.868
In a new interview,

00:09:03.868 --> 00:09:05.934
Rolling Stones guitarist
Keith Richards said

00:09:05.934 --> 00:09:08.234
that he quit smoking cigarettes
two years ago.

00:09:08.234 --> 00:09:10.901
And if you're wondering
how bad his habit got,

00:09:10.901 --> 00:09:12.367
he's 39.

00:09:12.367 --> 00:09:15.467
[ Laughter ]

00:09:15.467 --> 00:09:18.434
And, finally,
according to a new study,

00:09:18.434 --> 00:09:20.434
older adults who walk

00:09:20.434 --> 00:09:23.033
between 6,000
and 8,000 steps a day

00:09:23.033 --> 00:09:25.534
are 50% less likely to die early

00:09:25.534 --> 00:09:29.400
and 50% more likely to be lost
in a parking garage.

00:09:29.400 --> 00:09:30.601
[ Laughter ]

00:09:30.601 --> 00:09:31.734
"Where is it, Harold?!"

00:09:31.734 --> 00:09:33.534
I don't know, Helen!

00:09:33.534 --> 00:09:34.968
[ Laughter ]
♪♪

00:09:34.968 --> 00:09:37.801
The annual New York City
St. Patrick's Day Parade

00:09:37.801 --> 00:09:40.534
was held today after being
canceled for two years

00:09:40.534 --> 00:09:42.300
because of the coronavirus
pandemic.

00:09:42.300 --> 00:09:45.100
Of course, they've had
to update the buttons.

00:09:45.100 --> 00:09:48.767
[ Laughter ]

00:09:48.767 --> 00:09:50.901
President Biden is set
to speak tomorrow

00:09:50.901 --> 00:09:52.601
with Chinese President
Xi Jinping

00:09:52.601 --> 00:09:56.100
and Biden is all set to remind
China why they need us.

00:09:56.100 --> 00:09:59.601
[ Laughter ]

00:09:59.601 --> 00:10:01.167
Netflix announced yesterday

00:10:01.167 --> 00:10:04.400
that the political satire show
"Servant of the People"

00:10:04.400 --> 00:10:07.334
that stars Ukrainian President
Volodymyr Zelenskyy

00:10:07.334 --> 00:10:09.033
will return to the platform.

00:10:09.033 --> 00:10:12.567
And they're also taking down
Putin's standup special.

00:10:12.567 --> 00:10:14.400
[ Laughter ]

00:10:14.400 --> 00:10:16.267
[ Russian accent ] Yeah, so just
broke up with girlfriend.

00:10:16.267 --> 00:10:18.701
Feel bad.

00:10:18.701 --> 00:10:21.067
So I bought her a trip
to Siberia.

00:10:21.067 --> 00:10:25.067
This guy knows
what I'm talking about.

00:10:25.067 --> 00:10:26.701
President Biden
announced yesterday

00:10:26.701 --> 00:10:30.067
that the U.S. will provide a new
assistance package for Ukraine,

00:10:30.067 --> 00:10:33.133
which includes 800
anti-aircraft systems.

00:10:33.133 --> 00:10:36.434
We're giving them the best
anti-aircraft system we have --

00:10:36.434 --> 00:10:37.934
drunk passengers.

00:10:37.934 --> 00:10:40.701
[ Laughter ]

00:10:40.701 --> 00:10:42.734
[ Slurring ]
I'm not wearing a mask.

00:10:42.734 --> 00:10:45.901
[ Laughter ]

00:10:45.901 --> 00:10:49.033
A cargo ship named Ever Forward

00:10:49.033 --> 00:10:51.801
is stuck
in Maryland's Chesapeake Bay

00:10:51.801 --> 00:10:54.234
after running aground
on a sandbar.

00:10:54.234 --> 00:10:56.100
And they're really
rolling the dice

00:10:56.100 --> 00:10:58.534
by sending the Never Sinks
to save it.

00:10:58.534 --> 00:11:01.234
[ Laughter ]

00:11:03.200 --> 00:11:04.667
In a new interview
with Bloomberg,

00:11:04.667 --> 00:11:07.434
a sanctioned Russian billionaire
said that he now has to live

00:11:07.434 --> 00:11:10.534
on $3,300 per month.
That's weird.

00:11:10.534 --> 00:11:12.901
They're making him
teach high school?

00:11:12.901 --> 00:11:15.501
[ Laughter ]

00:11:15.501 --> 00:11:17.434
[ Audience groans ]

00:11:17.434 --> 00:11:19.167
Alright. [ Mutters ]

00:11:21.901 --> 00:11:25.701
[ Laughter ]

00:11:25.701 --> 00:11:27.734
Officials in Spain
recently impounded

00:11:27.734 --> 00:11:29.667
a third superyacht
that's believed

00:11:29.667 --> 00:11:32.501
to belong to a Russian oligarch,
mostly because they're not

00:11:32.501 --> 00:11:34.567
very creative
with their boat names.

00:11:34.567 --> 00:11:37.734
[ Laughter ]

00:11:37.734 --> 00:11:40.767
Republican Pennsylvania
Senate hopeful Dr. Mehmet Oz

00:11:40.767 --> 00:11:42.501
said yesterday
that he would renounce

00:11:42.501 --> 00:11:45.234
his dual Turkish citizenship
if he gets elecshed --

00:11:45.234 --> 00:11:46.267
elected, excuse me.

00:11:46.267 --> 00:11:48.334
No word yet on when
he'll renounce

00:11:48.334 --> 00:11:49.801
the title of doctor.

00:11:49.801 --> 00:11:51.901
[ Laughter ]

00:11:51.901 --> 00:11:54.801
Transportation officials
in New York yesterday announced

00:11:54.801 --> 00:11:57.234
plans to raise the flat fee
for a taxi

00:11:57.234 --> 00:12:00.300
between JFK Airport
and Manhattan to $65.

00:12:00.300 --> 00:12:01.534
That's crazy!

00:12:01.534 --> 00:12:04.534
That's almost $15 an hour.

00:12:04.534 --> 00:12:06.801
[ Laughter ]

00:12:09.133 --> 00:12:12.033
We mathed them.

00:12:12.033 --> 00:12:14.133
We fully mathed them.
That's on us.

00:12:14.133 --> 00:12:16.701
[ Laughter ]

00:12:18.601 --> 00:12:20.968
We didn't even give them pens
and paper or anything.

00:12:20.968 --> 00:12:23.434
[ Laughter ]

00:12:23.434 --> 00:12:26.901
And finally, tomorrow is
National Awkward Moments Day.

00:12:26.901 --> 00:12:29.167
This news first reported
by the guy who was

00:12:29.167 --> 00:12:31.634
actually waving to the person
behind you.

00:12:31.634 --> 00:12:34.100
[ Laughter ]

00:12:38.000 --> 00:12:39.667
And that was a monologue,
everybody.

00:12:39.667 --> 00:12:43.267
♪♪

00:12:43.267 --> 00:12:45.801
[ Cheering, whistling,
and applause ]

